  "whyPlay": "Deep Crafter takes factory automation underwater, and the setting alone gives it a distinct identity. Instead of conveyor belts sprawling across green fields, you're laying pipes on the ocean floor while managing oxygen and pressure. It's rougher than Factorio or Satisfactory, but the underwater setting and mining mechanics give it a genuinely fresh feel for automation fans looking for something different.",
  "whyPlayZh": "《深海工厂》把工厂自动化搬到了海底，光这个设定就有了独特辨识度。传送带不在绿地上蔓延，而是在海底铺设管道，同时还要管理氧气和水压。比异星工厂和幸福工厂粗糙些，但海底环境+采矿机制给自动化爱好者带来了真正新鲜的体验。"
